# Vendored frontend dependencies (self-hosted, no CDN).
# Rebuild: `make ui-css` (or `sh scripts/build-css.sh`).
# CSS compiled with Tailwind CSS v4 CLI from assets/corvus.css:
#   `@import "tailwindcss"; @plugin "daisyui";`
#   Tailwind v4 scans app/templates/ and app/static/ (@source), so rebuild
#   after adding new DaisyUI component classes to templates.
htmx.min.js: htmx.org 4.0.0 (npm htmx.org@4.0.0, dist/htmx.min.js)
alpine.min.js: Alpine.js 3.17.2 (npm alpinejs@3.17.2, dist/cdn.min.js)
daisyui.min.css: daisyUI 5.7.32 on Tailwind CSS 4.3.3 (npm daisyui@5.7.32, tailwindcss@4.3.3)
  Night-vault theme: daisyUI `lofi` (default, on <html>) + `business`
  (dark companion, via the Alpine theme-controller toggle only).
